@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> LoggedIn : login successful
LoggedIn --> ViewingStatus : view status
ViewingStatus --> CheckingStatus : check status
CheckingStatus --> LoggedIn : back to logged in
LoggedIn --> CancellingApplication : cancel application
CancellingApplication --> LoggedIn : back to logged in
LoggedIn --> ModifyingDetails : modify details
ModifyingDetails --> LoggedIn : back to logged in
LoggedIn --> ViewingDetails : view details
ViewingDetails --> LoggedIn : back to logged in
LoggedIn --> ViewingPurpose : view purpose
ViewingPurpose --> ApplicationDecision : document check
ApplicationDecision --> LoggedOut : approved or rejected
LoggedIn --> GivingFeedback : give feedback
GivingFeedback --> LoggedOut : feedback given
LoggedOut --> [*]
@enduml
